      "expected": 9,
      "explanation": "Clear 2 → 1 → 4 → 1 → 1 (right, right, down, down): 2 + 1 + 4 + 1 + 1 = 9 minutes. Going down the left side first costs 2 + 3 + 6 + 2 + 1 = 14."
